Signal Notes</a><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xl px-4 text-sm transition-colors text-white/65 hover:bg-white/[0.06] hover:text-white" href="/methodology">Methodology</a><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-xl px-4 text-sm transition-colors text-white/65 hover:bg-white/[0.06] hover:text-white" href="/about">About</a></div></div><a class="group relative inline-flex h-min w-fit select-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden p-px focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black rounded-full" href="/login"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -inset-[60%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,#ff6b6b,#feca57,#48dbfb,#ff9ff3,#54a0ff,#5f27cd,#ff6b6b)] opacity-80 transition-transform ease-out motion-reduce:transform-none motion-reduce:transition-none group-hover:rotate-180" style="transition-duration:1s"></span><span class="relative z-10 w-auto rounded-[inherit] bg-black px-5 py-2 text-sm font-body text-white/80">Login</span></a></nav></div></header><main id="main-content" tabindex="-1"><section class="relative h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/10 via-transparent via-50% to-black"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] pointer-events-none sm:hidden" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 135% 44% at 50% 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.62) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.42) 38%, rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 62%, transparent 84%)"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] pointer-events-none hidden sm:block" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 58% 42% at 50% 50%, rgba(0,0,0,0.96) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.82) 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.42) 48%, transparent 72%)"></div><div class="relative z-10 w-full min-w-0 text-center px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto"><p class="hero-enter-fade hero-delay-1 text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-white/30 font-body tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-6">Polymarket signal dashboard</p><div class="hero-enter-rise hero-delay-2 font-heading text-6xl min-[390px]:text-7xl sm:text-8xl lg:text-[9rem] font-light tracking-tight leading-[0.85]">Poly<em class="font-heading italic">track</em></div><h1 class="hero-enter-fade hero-delay-3 text-xl sm:text-2xl text-white/70 font-heading font-light mt-6 sm:mt-8">Track the trades that move markets.</h1><p class="hero-enter-fade hero-delay-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-white/35 font-body mt-4 sm:mt-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Polytrack flags large trades, volume spikes, new wallets, and coordinated movement, then keeps the market and wallet context one click away.</p><div class="hero-enter-rise hero-delay-4 mt-8 sm:mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3"><a class="group relative inline-flex h-min w-fit select-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden p-px focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black rounded-full hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" data-analytics-event="Public CTA" data-analytics-placement="home_hero" data-analytics-destination="/presignup" href="/presignup"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -inset-[60%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,#ff6b6b,#feca57,#48dbfb,#ff9ff3,#54a0ff,#5f27cd,#ff6b6b)] opacity-80 transition-transform ease-out motion-reduce:transform-none motion-reduce:transition-none group-hover:rotate-180" style="transition-duration:1s"></span><span class="relative z-10 w-auto rounded-[inherit] bg-black text-sm text-white font-body font-medium px-8 py-3 flex items-center gap-2">Start Tracking Now<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><a href="#included" data-analytics-event="Public CTA" data-analytics-placement="home_hero_secondary" data-analytics-destination="/#included" class="min-h-11 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-6 text-sm text-white/45 font-body hover:text-white/70 transition-colors">See What Is Included</a></div></div><div class="hero-enter-fade hero-delay-5 absolute bottom-12 left-1/2 z-10 flex -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] font-body uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/30">Scroll</span><div class="scroll-indicator-line h-8 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-white/40 to-transparent"></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 sm:py-28 lg:py-44 bg-black overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute pointer-events-none top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2" style="width:700px;height:700px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);filter:blur(80px)"></div><div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:0ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light mb-6 leading-[1.1]">Built for traders who need <em class="font-heading italic">signal</em> and context.</h2></div><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:150ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><p class="text-base text-white/60 font-body max-w-lg mx-auto mb-14 sm:mb-20 leading-relaxed">The dashboard turns raw Polymarket activity into a smaller set of flagged trades, explainable severity, and wallet-level follow-up.</p></div><div class="stagger-frame grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4" style="--stagger-2:120ms;--stagger-3:240ms;--stagger-4:360ms;--stagger-5:480ms;--stagger-6:600ms"><div class="stagger-item "><div class="h-full p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/[0.08] hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-500"><div class="text-3xl font-heading font-light text-white mb-2">24/7</div><div class="text-[10px] text-white/60 font-body uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Monitoring</div><p class="text-xs text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed mt-4">The monitor checks Polymarket continuously for flagged activity.</p></div></div><div class="stagger-item "><div class="h-full p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/[0.08] hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-500"><div class="text-3xl font-heading font-light text-white mb-2">8 rules</div><div class="text-[10px] text-white/60 font-body uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Severity context</div><p class="text-xs text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed mt-4">Alerts are scored from trade size, spikes, clustering, new wallets, and repeat activity.</p></div></div><div class="stagger-item "><div class="h-full p-7 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/[0.08] hover:bg-white/[0.03] transition-all duration-500"><div class="text-3xl font-heading font-light text-white mb-2">1 hub</div><div class="text-[10px] text-white/60 font-body uppercase tracking-[0.3em]">Signal to context</div><p class="text-xs text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed mt-4">Feed, wallet profiles, analytics, watchlists, and alerts stay in one workflow.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative h-[150vh] bg-black"><div class="sticky top-0 flex h-screen items-center justify-center"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center"><h2 class="font-heading text-5xl font-light leading-[1.15] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"><span class="inline-block transition-opacity duration-100 mr-[0.3em]" style="opacity:0.08"><em class="font-heading italic">Detect.</em></span><span class="inline-block transition-opacity duration-100 mr-[0.3em]" style="opacity:0.08"><em class="font-heading italic">Verify.</em></span><span class="inline-block transition-opacity duration-100 " style="opacity:0.08"><em class="font-heading italic">Track.</em></span></h2></div></div