ocused feed and rename panels around your own workflow.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Advanced filters</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Filter by time range, size preset, side, market, category, severity, probability, and resolution date.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Severity scoring</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">HIGH, MEDIUM, and LOW labels explain why a trade was flagged instead of showing every raw event equally.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:0ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><div class="relative h-full min-h-[280px] sm:min-h-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.05] bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.035),rgba(255,255,255,0.01))] p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.04)]"><div class="mb-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-body uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-200/70">Inspect</p><h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-white/80">Wallet context</h3></div><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-white/[0.14]">0<!-- -->2</span></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Trader profiles</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Inspect wallet metrics, positions, recent activity, PnL charts, volume, and markets traded.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Trader comparison</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Load two wallets side by side and compare volume, PnL, market count, and average trade size.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Leaderboard</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Scan top wallets by volume and average trade size across day, week, month, and all-time ranges.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">History and starred trades</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Review market-level history, resolution status, implied accuracy, and saved trades you want to revisit.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:0ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><div class="relative h-full min-h-[280px] sm:min-h-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.05] bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.035),rgba(255,255,255,0.01))] p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.04)]"><div class="mb-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-body uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-200/70">Context</p><h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-white/80">Market context</h3></div><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-white/[0.14]">0<!-- -->3</span></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Market heatmap</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Spot where flagged volume clusters by market, severity, category, and selected time range.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Analytics dashboard</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Track severity volume, buy/sell pressure, category breakdowns, top markets, top wallets, and new-wallet activity.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Breaking news feed</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Keep market-relevant headlines close to the trade data you are already watching.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:0ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><div class="relative h-full min-h-[280px] sm:min-h-[320px] rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.05] bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.035),rgba(255,255,255,0.01))] p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.04)]"><div class="mb-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><p class="mb-3 text-[10px] font-body uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-cyan-200/70">Follow</p><h3 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-white/80">Alerts and follow-up</h3></div><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-white/[0.14]">0<!-- -->4</span></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Wallet watchlist</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Follow specific wallets with optional labels and see their recent trades in a dedicated view.</p></div></div><div class="flex gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-cyan-300/[0.55]"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><div><p class="text-sm font-body text-white/70">Telegram alerts</p><p class="text-xs text-white/[0.32] font-body leading-relaxed mt-1">Send HIGH severity trades and watched-wallet activity to your own Telegram bot and chat.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-36 bg-black overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute pointer-events-none bottom-0 right-0 translate-x-1/4 translate-y-1/4" style="width:650px;height:650px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);filter:blur(80px)"></div><div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6"><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:0ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><div class="text-center mb-12"><p class="text-[10px] text-white/25 font-body uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">FAQ</p><h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light leading-[1.1]">Clear answers before you pay.</h2></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><details open="" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">What do I get, and what is the price?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">You get the full dashboard: live tracker, dual feeds, advanced filters, severity scoring, trader profiles, comparisons, leaderboard, heatmap, analytics, history, starred trades, watchlist, Telegram alerts, and news - however you pay. Choose a one-time $99.99 crypto payment for lifetime access, or a $10/week or $99.99/year card subscription.</p></details><details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">Is Polytrack affiliated with Polymarket?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">No. Polytrack is an independent dashboard for monitoring and analyzing Polymarket activity. It is not an exchange, broker, or first-party Polymarket application.</p></details><details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">Does Polytrack give financial advice or trade automatically?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">No. Polytrack does not place trades, manage funds, or tell you what to buy. Severity labels, including &quot;insider&quot; language, are heuristic screens - most flagged trades are not insider trading. See our Terms of Service for the full risk disclosure.</p></details><details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">How do Telegram alerts work?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">You connect your own Telegram bot token and chat ID, then choose HIGH severity alerts, watched-wallet alerts, or both.</p></details><details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">What makes a trade HIGH severity?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">Severity considers trade size, short-window volume, volume spikes, price movement, sensitive market categories, coordinated wallets, one-direction flow, accumulation, new wallets, and repeat flagged wallet activity.</p></details><details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">Can I follow specific wallets?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">Yes. Add any valid Polymarket wallet to your watchlist, label it if you want, and monitor its recent trades separately from the main feed.</p></details><details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">How quickly can I start?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">Create an account, complete checkout, and open the dashboard. Telegram is optional and can be connected from settings later.</p></details><details class="group overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/[0.04] bg-white/[0.015]"><summary class="flex min-h-14 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.025] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-sm sm:text-base font-body text-white/70 leading-snug">Can I cancel?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-white/25 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><p class="px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-white/60 font-body leading-relaxed">The one-time crypto payment is a lifetime purchase, so there is nothing to cancel. A weekly or yearly card subscription can be canceled anytime; cancelling stops future renewals but does not refund the current period.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="relative scroll-mt-24 pt-24 sm:pt-32 lg:pt-44 pb-20 sm:pb-24" id="pricing"><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 25%, transparent 85%, black 100%)"></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-lg mx-auto px-6 text-center"><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:0ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light mb-10 sm:mb-14 drop-shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]">Start monitoring with context.</h2></div><div class="reveal-frame " style="--reveal-x:0px;--reveal-y:40px;--reveal-delay:200ms;--reveal-duration:800ms"><div class="relative rounded-2xl bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.08] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),0_0_160px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]"><div class="absolute top-0 left-4 right-4 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/15 to-transparent"></div><div class="p-10 sm:p-14 flex flex-col items-center gap-7"><p class="text-sm text-white/40 font-body max-w-xs leading-relaxed">Create an account, then choose how you&#x27;d like to pay.</p><a class="group relative inline-flex h-min select-none items-center justify-center overflow-hidden p-px focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/70 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-black rounded-full w-full hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" data-analytics-event="Public CTA" data-analytics-placement="home_pricing" data-analytics-destination="/presignup" href="/presignup"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -inset-[60%] bg-[conic-gradient(from_0deg,#ff6b6b,#feca57,#48dbfb,#ff9ff3,#54a0ff,#5f27cd,#ff6b6b)] opacity-80 transition-transform ease-out motion-reduce:transform-none motion-reduce:transition-none group-hover:rotate-180" style="transition-duration:1s"></span><span class="relative z-10 rounded-[inherit] bg-black text-base text-white font-body font-semibold px-10 py-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full whitespace-nowrap">Start Tracking Now<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-5 h-5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span></a><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-left w-full max-w-sm"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/35"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-[11px] text-white/40 font-body">Live tracker</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/35"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-[11px] text-white/40 font-body">Dual trade feeds</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/35"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-[11px] text-white/40 font-body">Advanced filters</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/35"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-[11px] text-white/40 font-body">Severity scoring</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/35"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-[11px] text-white/40 font-body">Trader profiles</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width